{
  "id": "prog-wendler-531-week-3",
  "title": "5/3/1 – Week 3 (5/3/1)",
  "creator": "Jim Wendler",
  "description": "Jim Wendler's 5/3/1: one main lift per day (press, deadlift, bench, squat), three work sets a week at rising percentages of a training max set at 90% of your 1RM, last set for max reps. Week 1 is 5s (65/75/85%), week 2 3s (70/80/90%), week 3 5/3/1 (75/85/95%), week 4 a deload (40/50/60%); then add 2.5 kg to the press/bench TM and 5 kg to squat/deadlift and repeat. Each block here is a separate training day. Add assistance after the main lift (e.g. Boring But Big 5×10 at 50%, or 50–100 reps each of a push, a pull and a single-leg/core move).",
